        <mxCell id="wNoVIlVxudSAycJl5D7B-19" value="- &lt;b&gt;Semi-manual T-order process&lt;/b&gt;. User manually selects the part from stock to be transferred and the system automatically&amp;nbsp; creates a T-order with the selected part (Serial NUmber/Batch Number). Then, th euser has to specify the &quot;destination&quot; station inside the T-order. &lt;b&gt;Only one part can be transferred at a time&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;horizontal=1;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingTop=2;" parent="zzo48K5w6el02u5jim_O-1" vertex="1">
